-red">The Headline</h3><div class="mt-1.5"><div class="flex items-center gap-2.5"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-1"><p class="font-utility text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wide text-ink">Law Digest</p></div></div></div></div></div></a></div></div></div><div class="mt-6 text-center md:hidden"><a class="border-b border-digest-red pb-1 font-utility text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wide text-digest-red transition-opacity hover:opacity-70" href="/articles">View all articles →</a></div></div></section><section class="border-t border-hairline bg-digest-red text-paper"><div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-20"><div data-reveal="" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(24px)"><div class="grid gap-12 md:grid-cols-2 md:items-center"><div><p class="font-utility text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-white/75">§ Inside Law Digest</p><h2 class="mt-3 font-display text-3xl italic text-white md:text-4xl">Africa&#x27;s Premier Law Journal</h2><div class="mt-6 space-y-4 font-body text-base italic leading-relaxed text-white/90"><p>Law Digest is a quarterly international publication published in the UK and distributed across the US, London, Ghana, South Africa, Canada, Nigeria, and East Africa.</p><p>We are the publisher of Africa&#x27;s first and only international law magazine aimed at African legal practitioners both home and abroad — featuring international contributors from the major common law jurisdictions.</p><p>With over 5,000 copies distributed globally and 50,000+ online readers, Law Digest bridges the gap between legal scholarship and practical legal journalism.</p></div><div class="mt-8 flex items-center gap-6"><a class="group border-b-2 border-white pb-1 font-utility text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wide text-white transition-all duration-300 hover:border-white/50 hover:text-white/80" href="/about">Learn more about us →</a><a class="group border-b-2 border-white/30 pb-1 font-utility text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wide text-white/70 transition-all duration-300 hover:border-white hover:text-white" href="/contributors">Meet our Editorial Board →</a></div></div><div class="relative"><div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4"><div class="border border-white/[0.12] bg-white/[0.06] p-5 transition-all duration-300 hover:border-white/40 hover:bg-white/[0.12]"><p class="font-utility text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-white/75">Founded</p><p class="mt-2 font-display text-2xl italic text-paper">2013</p><p class="mt-1 font-utility text-[10px] font-medium uppercase tracking-wide text-white/65">London, UK</p></div><div class="border border-white/[0.12] bg-white/[0.06] p-5 transition-all duration-300 hover:border-white/40 hover:bg-white/[0.12]"><p class="font-utility text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-white/75">Distribution</p><p class="mt-2 font-display text-2xl italic text-paper">7+</p><p class="mt-1 font-utility text-[10px] font-medium uppercase tracking-wide text-white/65">Countries worldwide</p></div><div class="border border-white/[0.12] bg-white/[0.06] p-5 transition-all duration-300 hover:border-white/40 hover:bg-white/[0.12]"><p class="font-utility text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-white/75">Copies</p><p class="mt-2 font-display text-2xl italic text-paper">5,000+</p><p class="mt-1 font-utility text-[10px] font-medium uppercase tracking-wide text-white/65">Printed per issue</p></div><div class="border border-white/[0.12] bg-white/[0.06] p-5 transition-all duration-300 hover:border-white/40 hover:bg-white/[0.12]"><p class="font-utility text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-white/75">Online</p><p class="mt-2 font-display text-2xl italic text-paper">50,000+</p><p class="mt-1 font-utility text-[10px] font-medium uppercase tracking-wide text-white/65">Digital readers</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="border-t border-hairline bg-hairline/30"><div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-20"><div data-reveal="" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(24px)"><div class="flex flex-col gap-6 sm:flex-row sm:items-end sm:justify-between"><div class="mb-10"><p class="font-utility text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-digest-red">§ <!-- -->Practice Areas</p><div class="mt-3 flex items-end gap-4"><h2 class="font-display text-3xl italic leading-tight text-ink md:text-4xl">Coverage areas</h2></div><div class="mt-4 flex items-center gap-3"><span class="block h-px flex-1 bg-hairline"></span><span class="block h-1.5 w-1.5 bg-digest-red"></span><span class="block h-px flex-1 bg-hairline"></span></div></div><svg viewBox="0 0 200 160" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-20 w-20 shrink-0 opacity-25" aria-hidden="true" role="img"><rect x="96" y="20" width="8" height="120" fill="#e4e1d9"></rect><rect x="70" y="136" width="60" height="6" rx="1" fill="#17140f"></rect><rect x="30" y="36" width="140" height="4" rx="1" fill="#17140f"></rect><line x1="50" y1="40" x2="50" y2="70" stroke="#A51C30" stroke-width="2"></line><line x1="30" y1="40" x2="70" y2="40" stroke="#A51C30" stroke-width="2"></line><path d="M30 70 Q50 90 70 70" stroke="#A51C30" stroke-width="2" fill="none"></path><line x1="150" y1="40" x2="150" y2="70" stroke="#A51C30" stroke-width="2"></line><line x1="130" y1="40" x2="170" y2="40" stroke="#A51C30" stroke-width="2"></line><path d="M130 70 Q150 90 170 70" stroke="#A51C30" stroke-width="2" fill="none"></path><circle cx="100" cy="20" r="6" fill="#A51C30"></circle></svg></div><ul class="grid gap-px overflow-hidden border border-hairline bg-hairline sm:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3"><li class="group relative"><a class="block bg-paper transition-colors duration-300 hover:bg-ink hover:text-paper" href="/practice-areas/arbitration"><div class="px-5 py-5"><span class="block font-admin text-[14px] font-semibold uppercase">Arbitration</span><span class="mt-2 block font-body text-[13px] font-normal leading-relaxed normal-case text-stone transition-colors duration-300 group-hover:text-paper/75">LawDigest explores disputes, arbitration proceedings, and emerging developments in alternative dispute resolution. We examine important decisions, practical issues, and trends shaping how commercial disputes are resolved.</span></div></a><span class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 h-0.5 w-0 bg-purple transition-all duration-500 group-hover:w-full"></span></li><li class="group relative"><a class="block bg-paper transition-colors duration-300 hover:bg-ink hover:text-paper" href="/practice-areas/banking-finance"><div class="px-5 py-5"><span class="block font-admin text-[14px] font-semibold uppercase">Banking &amp; Finance</span><span class="mt-2 block font-body text-[13px] font-normal leading-relaxed normal-case text-stone transition-colors duration-300 group-hover:text-paper/75">LawDigest follows legal and regulatory developments affecting banks, financial institutions, businesses, and investors. Our coverage explores financial transactions, lending, regulation, compliance, and emerging issues within the financial sector.</span></div></a><span class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 h-0.5 w-0 bg-purple transition-all duration-500 group-hover:w-full"></span></li><li class="group relative"><a class="block bg-paper transition-colors duration-300 hover:bg-ink hover:text-paper" href="/practice-areas/capital-markets"><div class="px-5 py-5"><span class="block font-admin text-[14px] font-semibold uppercase">Capital Markets</span><span class="mt-2 block font-body text-[13px] font-normal leading-relaxed normal-case text-stone transition-colors duration-300 group-hover:text-paper/75">LawDigest covers legal and regulatory developments within Nigeria’s capital markets. We examine securities, investments, public offerings, market regulation, investor protection, and the legal issues influencing capital-market activity.</span></div></a><span class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 h-0.5 w-0 bg-purple transition-all duration-500 group-hover:w-full"></span></li><li class="group relative"><a class="block bg-paper transition-colors duration-300 hover:bg-ink hover:text-paper" href="/practice-areas/commercial-corporate-law"><div class="px-5 py-5"><span class="block font-admin text-[14px] font-semibold uppercase">Commercial &amp; Corporate Law</span><span class="mt-2 block font-body text-[13px] font-normal leading-relaxed normal-case text-stone transition-colors duration-300 group-hover:text-paper/75">LawDigest covers the legal developments shaping businesses, companies, and commercial transactions. Our coverage explores corporate structures, contracts, mergers and acquisitions, business regulation, and emerging issues affecting the corporate world.</span></div></a><span class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 h-0.5 w-0 bg-purple transition-all duration-500 group-hover:w-full"></span></li><li class="group relative"><a class="block bg-paper transition-colors duration-300 hover:bg-ink hover:text-paper" href="/practice-areas/consumer-protection"><div class="px-5 py-5"><span class="block font-admin text-[14px] font-semibold uppercase">Consumer Protection</span><span class="mt-2 block font-body text-[13px] font-normal leading-relaxed normal-case text-stone transition-colors duration-300 group-hover:text-paper/75">LawDigest examines legal developments affecting consumers and their rights in the marketplace. We highlight important regulations, decisions, disputes, and emerging issues involving businesses, products, services, and consumer interests.</span></div></a><span class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 h-0.5 w-0 bg-purple transition-all duration-500 group-hover:w-full"></span></li><li class="group relative"><a class="block bg-paper transition-colors duration-300 hover:bg-ink hover:text-paper" href="/practice-areas/corporate-governance"><div class="px-5 py-5"><span class="block font-admin text-[14px] font-semibold uppercase">Corporate Governance</span><span class="mt-2 block font-body text-[13px] font-normal leading-relaxed normal-case text-stone transition-colors duration-300 group-hover:text-paper/75">LawDigest examines the principles, regulations, and practices that shape how companies are directed and held accountable. We cover board responsibilities, corporate compliance, transparency, shareholder interests, and developments in corporate governance.</span></div></a><span class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 h-0.5 w-0 bg-purple transition-all duration-500 group-hover:w-full"></span></li><li class="group relative"><a class="block bg-paper transition-colors duration-300 hover:bg-ink hover:text-paper" href="/practice-areas/energy-law"><div class="px-5 py-5"><span class="block font-admin text-[14px] font-semibold uppercase">Energy Law</span><span class="mt-2 block font-body text-[13px] font-normal leading-relaxed normal-case text-stone transition-colors duration-300 group-hover:text-paper/75">LawDigest covers the legal and regulatory developments shaping the energy sector. Our coverage explores oil and gas, electricity, renewable energy, regulation, commercial transactions, and the evolving legal framework of Nigeria’s energy industry.</span></div></a><span class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 h-0.5 w-0 bg-purple transition-all duration-500 group-hover:w-full"></span></li><li class="group relative"><a class="block bg-paper transition-colors duration-300 hover:bg-ink hover:text-paper" href="/practice-areas/entertainment-law"><div class="px-5 py-5"><span class="block font-admin text-[14px] font-semibold uppercase">Entertainment Law</span><span class="mt-2 block font-body text-[13px] font-normal leading-relaxed normal-case text-stone transition-colors duration-300 group-hover:text-paper/75">LawDigest explores the legal issues shaping Nigeria’s entertainment and creative industries. Our coverage examines contracts, copyright, licensing, talent management, royalties, media rights, and emerging legal developments affecting creative professionals.</span></div></a><span class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 h-0.5 w-0 bg-purple transition-all duration-500 group-hover:w-full"></span></li><li class="group relative"><a class="block bg-paper transition-colors duration-300 hover:bg-ink hover:text-paper" href="/practice-areas/intellectual-property"><div class="px-5 py-5"><span class="block font-admin text-[14px] font-semibold uppercase">Intellectual Property</span><span class="mt-2 block font-body text-[13px] font-normal leading-relaxed normal-case text-stone transition-colors duration-300 group-hover:text-paper/75">LawDigest examines legal developments surrounding the protection and commercial use of creative and innovative works. We cover trademarks, copyright, patents, branding, technology, and the evolving challenges of protecting intellectual assets.</span></div></a><span class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 h-0.5 w-0 bg-purple transition-all duration-500 group-hover:w-full"></span></li><li class="group relative"><a class="block bg-paper transition-colors duration-300 hover:bg-ink hover:text-paper" href="/practice-areas/technology-law"><div class="px-5 py-5"><span class="block font-admin text-[14px] font-semibold uppercase">Technology Law</span><span class="mt-2 block font-body text-[13px] font-normal leading-relaxed normal-case text-stone transition-colors duration-300 group-hover:text-paper/75">LawDigest examines the legal implications of technology, innovation, and the digital economy. We cover emerging issues around data, artificial intelligence, cybersecurity, digital platforms, intellectual property, and technology regulation.</span></div></a><span class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 h-0.5 w-0 bg-purple transition-all duration-500 group-hover:w-full"></span></li></ul></div></div></section><section class="border-t border-hairline bg-digest-red text-paper"><div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-20"><div data-reveal="" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(24px)"><div class="grid gap-12 md:grid-cols-2 md:items-center"><div><div class="flex items-end gap-6"><p class="font-utility text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-white/70">Newsletter</p><svg viewBox="0 0 200 140" fill="none" xmlns="http: